er X11 everything works as expected.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n- Run > Platforms > Prefer Wayland\n- Enable Occlusion Culling under Project Settings\n- Create a MeshInstance and make a Occluder Node a child of the MeshInstance\n- place some meshes behind the first MeshInstance\n- Enable Wireframe view to see the Occlusion in action\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nopen the node_3d.tscn in godot, instant crash\n\n[occlusion-test.tar.gz](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/20174502/occlusion-test.tar.gz)","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/106318/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/106318/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null}